OL,3,GNEWSARecord number of hedgehogs taken
OL,4,Ain by rescue centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rescue centre says it is caring for a
OL,7,Frecord number of hedgehogs after
OL,8,Fextreme heat and dry conditions left
OL,9,Fmany dehydrated and malnourished.
OL,11,FOxfordshire Wildlife Rescue founder
OL,12,FLuke Waclawek said the situation was a
OL,13,Fworrying sign for the future of the
OL,14,Fspecies.
OL,16,FThe rescue centre is currently caring
OL,17,Ffor around 150 hedgehogs.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
