OL,3,GNEWSARecord number of hedgehogs taken
OL,4,Ain by rescue centre
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are seeing these animals coming in
OL,7,Fdue to dehydration and malnourishment.
OL,8,FThe youngsters are losing contact with
OL,9,Ftheir natural mothers earlier than
OL,10,Fusual," he said.
